The applicant is ordered to be released on regular bail in connection with the FIR being C.R. No.I- 611/2001 registered with the 'B' Division Police Station,
Rajkot on executing a personal bond of Rs.15,000/- (Rupees Fifteen Thousand only) with one surety of the like amount to the satisfaction of the trial Court and subject to the conditions that he shall;
